    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "kizuna_math_a_05",
      "hash64": "FA7C78782654497E",
      "text": "有哪個地方難懂呢？\\n和老師我一起來學習吧！[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
